    items.xml - MTT (WoofWorks) master item list
    weight is always in KG

    There is no Minecraft-style inventory stack system. Carrying capacity
    is weight-based: the player has a max carry weight, and every item's
    <weight> counts against it (a pile of bread loaves is fine, two car
    batteries might not be). This can later be expanded via equippable
    storage like a backpack.

    perishable="true" items should have a spoil_time_hours value
-->
